 "posts": [
  "SCHEDULED POWER INTERRUPTION: NOVEMBER 7, 2026\nGinapahibalo sang Negros Power ang mga konsumidores nga may ara sang natalana nga power interruption sa NOVEMBER 7, 2026 (Saturday).\nIni kabahin sang 5-year rehabilitation kag modernization plan sang Negros Power agud malikawan ang mga wala ginalauman kag mas lapnagon nga power interruptions kag mangin reliable ang distribution system sang aton elektrisidad.\nYari ang mga detalye sang scheduled power interruption:\nDate: November 7, 2026 (Saturday)\nReason: Rehabilitaion of 12-spans secondary line and upgrading of 1-25KVa to 1-37.5kva common Distribution Transformer.\nTime & Affected Areas:\n8:00AM to 5:00PM\nPortion of TF3 -  Portion of Zone 5, Hda. Bocboc, Hda.  Angeles, Brgy. Concepcion, Talisay City.\nMadamo gid nga salamat sa inyo nga pag hangop.\n#NegrosPowerRehab\n#PadayonAngRehabilitasyon\n#ForBetterElectricService"
 ],
